iron, not harmed by it in the HP sort of way. For worn iron, reduce
weight_cap() by 100 (equivalent to a wounded leg) for each such item 
(or maybe by the area and force of contact; body armor: 250; 
helm/weapon/shoes/gloves/shield: 100; ring/amulet: 50; ball/beartrap: 300).
